OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a dry and mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy morning. Cloudy in the
OL,7,Fafternoon with rain, heavy at times,
OL,8,Fspreading eastwards. Southeasterly
OL,9,Fwinds strengthening and becoming
OL,10,Fstrong in places, especially around
OL,11,Fthe coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with heavy rain and
OL,14,Fstrong winds this evening. Winds
OL,15,Feasing as rain clears to the east
OL,16,Fovernight with clear spells developing
OL,17,Fin the east, becoming cold here.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
