OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FIt will be a mostly dry day
OL,6,Fwith variable cloud and bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells, best of the brightness
OL,8,Fin the west.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,11,Fspells and showers on Saturday. Breezy
OL,12,Fwith bright spells and showers on
OL,13,FSunday. Further rain and strong winds
OL,14,Farriving from the west on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
